{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neon Striker is a roguelike top-down shooter, except you don't do the shooting. Acquire and assemble guns that attach to your ship and automatically fire at enemies within range. Meanwhile, you must expertly pilot your ship to weave through enemies and align your weapons to get the perfect angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/extras/ship_select_gif.gif?t=1742263879\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find your playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of ships, each with its own custom weapons and configurations. Customize your ship to fit your playstyle by assigning weapons to slots. Every configuration has its strengths and weaknesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/extras/workshop_gif.gif?t=1742263879\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592710?t=1742263879","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/1b7ce9e8408d0179b9f025c0f0c18e0404c0c136/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742263879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/472f068d1e92def7a3577a985701b0035f8316ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742263879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/472f068d1e92def7a3577a985701b0035f8316ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742263879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neon Striker is a roguelike top-down shooter, except you don't do the shooting. Acquire and assemble guns that attach to your ship and automatically fire at enemies within range. Meanwhile, you must expertly pilot your ship to weave through enemies and align your weapons to get the perfect angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/extras/ship_select_gif.gif?t=1742263879\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find your playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of ships, each with its own custom weapons and configurations. Customize your ship to fit your playstyle by assigning weapons to slots. Every configuration has its strengths and weaknesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/extras/workshop_gif.gif?t=1742263879\" /></p>","developers":["Zeno's Adventure Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592710/c1237904c048569316b6e72d8cbc1dc6513c1d27/header.jpg?t=1742263879","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113736,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113736/movie480.mp4?t=1741979324","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113736/movie_max.mp4?t=1741979324"},"name":"gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113736/0a5a125e1e13fd73bc68d713f3e2a28ce65dbc28/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741979324","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113736/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741979324","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113736/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741979324"}}],"name":"Neon Striker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_